1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:02,290
(Penny:)it all worked out.

2
00:00:02,288 --> 00:00:05,628
(Bernadette:)When you go to Emily's office to
practice, you'll see. It's fine.

3
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:07,295
(Penny:)Yeah, I hope you're right.

4
00:00:07,293 --> 00:00:09,423
(Amy:)You really went your entire life

5
00:00:09,429 --> 00:00:12,899
(Amy:)without anyone saying
"I hate you" to your face?

6
00:00:12,899 --> 00:00:14,529
(Leonard:)Yeah.

7
00:00:14,534 --> 00:00:18,434
(Amy:)I'd say it now,
but look at those cheekbones.

8
00:00:22,742 --> 00:00:25,372
(rock music playing)

9
00:00:25,378 --> 00:00:27,378
(Sheldon:)I miss
Stuart's place.

10
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:31,050
(Sheldon:)All this loud music
and exposed brick.

11
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:33,320
(Sheldon:)What, is this
a comic book store,

12
00:00:33,319 --> 00:00:36,619
(Sheldon:)or a rave at the third
little pig's house?

13
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:39,990
Yup, I wish
Stuart would reopen.

14
00:00:39,993 --> 00:00:41,993
(Howard:)I hate this place, too.

15
00:00:41,995 --> 00:00:43,825
(Leonard:)Okay, him I believe

16
00:00:43,830 --> 00:00:46,960
(Leonard:)because he's an 80-year-old man
in a 15-year-old's T-shirt.

17
00:00:46,966 --> 00:00:48,766
(Leonard:)But you're just upset

18
00:00:48,768 --> 00:00:52,308
(Leonard:)about Stuart and your mom
and all their HBOs.

19
00:00:52,305 --> 00:00:55,675
(Howard:)Yes, I am. You know, I can't
even watch Game of Thrones now

20
00:00:55,675 --> 00:00:57,375
(Howard:)without thinking
of mother saying,

21
00:00:57,377 --> 00:01:01,027
"Stuart, which one is Thrones?"

